{
  "1": [
    {
      "text": "Most people do their research before",
      "startSec": 0,
      "endSec": 1.9300000000000002
    },
    {
      "text": "picking up the phone.",
      "startSec": 1.9300000000000002,
      "endSec": 3.18
    },
    {
      "text": "If your website does not answer their",
      "startSec": 3.18,
      "endSec": 5.02
    },
    {
      "text": "basic questions, what you do, where you",
      "startSec": 5.02,
      "endSec": 7.07
    },
    {
      "text": "are, and how to reach you,",
      "startSec": 7.07,
      "endSec": 8.46
    },
    {
      "text": "they move on to someone who does.",
      "startSec": 8.46,
      "endSec": 10.34
    },
    {
      "text": "Your site is your first impression, and",
      "startSec": 10.34,
      "endSec": 12.14
    },
    {
      "text": "most of the time, you are not there to",
      "startSec": 12.14,
      "endSec": 13.6
    },
    {
      "text": "make it in person.",
      "startSec": 13.6,
      "endSec": 14.5
    }
  ],
  "2": [
    {
      "text": "Businesses with a dedicated contact",
      "startSec": 0,
      "endSec": 2.08
    },
    {
      "text": "page get three times more inquiries",
      "startSec": 2.08,
      "endSec": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "than",
      "startSec": 4,
      "endSec": 4.16
    },
    {
      "text": "those that only have a phone number in",
      "startSec": 4.16,
      "endSec": 5.63
    },
    {
      "text": "the footer. Not just a link, a full",
      "startSec": 5.63,
      "endSec": 7.92
    },
    {
      "text": "page",
      "startSec": 7.92,
      "endSec": 8.16
    },
    {
      "text": "with your address, your hours, a map,",
      "startSec": 8.16,
      "endSec": 10.17
    },
    {
      "text": "and a form. Most small business sites",
      "startSec": 10.17,
      "endSec": 12.17
    },
    {
      "text": "skip it",
      "startSec": 12.17,
      "endSec": 12.5
    },
    {
      "text": "entirely and wonder why people are not",
      "startSec": 12.5,
      "endSec": 14.71
    },
    {
      "text": "calling.",
      "startSec": 14.71,
      "endSec": 16.36
    }
  ],
  "3": [
    {
      "text": "When someone finds your site, here is",
      "startSec": 0,
      "endSec": 1.77
    },
    {
      "text": "where they go.",
      "startSec": 1.77,
      "endSec": 2.68
    },
    {
      "text": "Almost everyone hits the home page, but",
      "startSec": 2.68,
      "endSec": 4.53
    },
    {
      "text": "74% navigate straight to your services",
      "startSec": 4.53,
      "endSec": 6.47
    },
    {
      "text": "page.",
      "startSec": 6.47,
      "endSec": 6.96
    },
    {
      "text": "That is your most important content.",
      "startSec": 6.96,
      "endSec": 8.88
    },
    {
      "text": "61% look for a contact page.",
      "startSec": 8.88,
      "endSec": 10.96
